      "id": "claim_0006fdf6e9ac42dc9be90e30274448f3",
      "statement": "The workflow produces a proposed advisory decision in `decision/proposed.json` by combining the upstream policy check, Companies House, financial assessment, and web search outputs, and it persists the proposed payload separately from the final report.",
